The spec (§W3–W4) describes:

- Content hashing of candidate artifacts
- Target binding verification
- Canonical comparison against existing implementations
- Placement manifest generation
- Human approval gate before repository changes

**Status:** ❌ Not implemented.

### 16. Runtime / Browser / Composer Verification Pipeline

The spec (§W5–W6) describes:

- Composer registration and discoverability verification
- Schema compatibility verification
- Renderer routing verification
- Runtime behavior verification
- Browser verification
- Theme/brand independence verification
- ILS/LSNB/RSSB boundary verification
