### Critical Rules (from I1/C1/D1 spec)

- ✅ **UBRC attributes**: `data-block-id`, `data-block-type`, `data-block-version` on the root `<article>`
- ✅ **Theme-driven**: Use `theme.primary` / `theme.secondary` — never hardcode brand colors
- ✅ **One file for ALL brands** — no SUIA/RTH-specific variants
- ✅ **Version router**: `switch(block.version)` with exhaustive check
- ❌ **No ILS imports** — passive participation only
- ❌ **No navigation/progress UI** — page-level LSNB/RSSB handles that

